    "long_desc": "The shrine was built for a bell that no longer hangs here. The arch survives, and beneath it an altar of black stone that the water has not managed to move in four decades. Behind the altar the wall is not quite a wall \u2014 the stones there were cut to a different pattern, by someone in a hurry.",
